@startuml
title ED Simulation System - Combined Sequence Diagram\n(Nurse View + Admin View)

skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #f0f8ff
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #1e88e5
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #e8f5e9
skinparam ActorBorderColor #2e7d32
skinparam BoxBackgroundColor #fff3e0
skinparam BoxBorderColor #f57c00

actor "Nurse / User" as Nurse #2e7d32
actor "Admin / Technical User" as Admin #1565c0

box "ED Simulation System" #e3f2fd
    participant "Nurse Interface" as NurseUI #e8f5e9
    participant "Admin Interface" as AdminUI #bbdefb
    participant "Simulation Engine" as Engine #fff3e0
end box

== Nurse View Flow ==
Nurse -> NurseUI : **Register Patient** <<register>>
NurseUI -> Engine : addPatient()
Engine --> NurseUI : Patient Added
NurseUI --> Nurse : Update Patient List

Nurse -> NurseUI : **Run Simulation** <<simulation>>
NurseUI -> Engine : runFullSimulation()

Engine -> Engine : **Compute Utility → SoftMax → Assignment** #ff9800
Engine -> Engine : **Compute Queue → Deterioration → ESI** #f44336

Engine --> NurseUI : Update Unit Cards
Engine --> NurseUI : Update Patient List + Alerts
NurseUI --> Nurse : **Simulation Complete**

Nurse -> NurseUI : Select Patient
NurseUI -> Engine : selectPatient()
Engine --> NurseUI : Patient Details
NurseUI --> Nurse : Show Detail Panel

Nurse -> NurseUI : **Generate Charts**
NurseUI -> Engine : renderCharts()
Engine --> NurseUI : Severity, Probability, Waiting Time, Occupancy Charts

== Admin / Technical View Flow ==
Admin -> AdminUI : Switch to Admin View

Admin -> AdminUI : **Compute Step by Step**
AdminUI -> Engine : computeUtility() / computeSoftmax() etc.
Engine --> AdminUI : Show Detailed Tables

Admin -> AdminUI : View Queue / Deterioration / ESI
AdminUI -> Engine : computeQueue() / computeDeterioration() / computeESIUpdate()
Engine --> AdminUI : Return Analysis Results

== Shared Actions ==
NurseUI <--> AdminUI : Shared Data (patients, results)
Admin -> AdminUI : Load Sample Data / Clear All

@enduml